==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
**5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Players who own [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] should have no trouble beating this stage.

